@startuml
title D-04 Continuity Activation and Post-Restoration Review Governance Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Supervisor
actor "Operations / Reconciliation" as Ops
participant "Operator Console" as Console
participant "ExitPass Continuity" as Continuity
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Continuity Terminal" as Terminal
participant "Dashboard / Reports" as Reports

Supervisor -> Console : review degraded condition
Console -> Continuity : approve activation where policy allows\nwith incident / BCP reference
Continuity -> Central : set scoped degraded state
Central -> Terminal : enable Continuity Terminal if allowed
Continuity -> Reports : publish activation context

... restoration ...

Supervisor -> Console : review deactivation criteria
Console -> Continuity : approve deactivation
Continuity -> Central : close degraded state
Central -> Terminal : disable continuity mode
Ops -> Console : perform post-restoration review
Console -> Reports : update reconciliation outcome

note over Console
Console governs and reviews continuity.
It does not become the Continuity Terminal
and does not collect payment.
end note

@enduml
